Description: Start MultiFlexi run-templates for services on a paid AbraFlexi invoice
 Reads a paid AbraFlexi issued invoice and schedules the MultiFlexi
 run-templates of the ordered services (e.g. abraflexi-domain-credit and
 abraflexi-voip-credit), when such run-templates exist.

